{"workspace":"c1ed9ba4-e485-4377-8374-7685abf4247d","collection":{"info":{"_postman_id":"am-mcp-12-tools-prod","name":"AM MCP 12 Tools — Prod","description":"Smoke-test all **12 fin-agent MCP read tools** on prod (`https://am.asrax.in`).\n\n## Quick start\n1. Import environment **AM MCP Tools — Prod** (`AM-MCP-Tools-Prod.postman_environment.json`)\n2. Set `access_token` to your JWT (no `Bearer ` prefix)\n3. Run **00 Setup → Login** or paste token manually\n4. Run requests in **01–04 REST Smoke** (recommended for Postman)\n\n## Two test modes\n| Folder | What it tests |\n|--------|----------------|\n| **01–04 REST Smoke** | Gateway REST closest to each MCP tool (easy in Postman) |\n| **99 MCP tools/call** | True MCP JSON-RPC via SSE session (exact tool behavior) |\n\n## MCP-only via REST folder\nThese have **no public REST** on the gateway — use **99 MCP tools/call**:\n- `get_holdings` (analysis Mongo via MCP)\n- `get_sector_allocation`\n- `get_market_cap_allocation`\n\nREST folder includes **portfolio proxy** for holdings/holding_detail where noted.\n\n## MCP SSE session (folder 99)\nPostman cannot hold SSE open natively. Get a session id once:\n```powershell\n# Terminal — keep SSE stream running; copy sessionId from first events\ncurl.exe -N -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT\" -H \"Accept: text/event-stream\" https://am.asrax.in/mcp/sse\n```\nSet env var `mcp_session_id` from the `id:` line, then run folder **99** requests.\n\n## Prod gotchas\n- Market movers: `/market/v1/analysis/movers` (NOT `market-analytics/movers`)\n- Indices batch: `POST .../indices/batch?forceRefresh=false` with body `[\"NIFTY 50\",\"NIFTY BANK\"]` (`SENSEX` invalid on NSE list)\n- Movers `type`: lowercase `gainers`, `losers`, or `all`","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["const token = pm.environment.get('access_token') || pm.collectionVariables.get('access_token');","if (token) {","  const bare = token.replace(/^Bearer\\s+/i, '').trim();","  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + bare });","  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', bare);","} else if (!pm.request.url.path.includes('login') && !pm.request.url.path.includes('actuator/health')) {","  console.warn('Missing access_token — select AM MCP Tools — Prod environment');","}"]}}],"auth":{"type":"bearer","bearer":[{"key":"token","value":"{{access_token}}","type":"string"}]},"variable":[{"key":"base_url","value":"https://am.asrax.in"},{"key":"access_token","value":""},{"key":"user_id","value":"670116d7-8683-4f35-bdb6-7cf6fb122068"},{"key":"symbol","value":"RELIANCE"},{"key":"portfolio_id","value":""},{"key":"mcp_session_id","value":"","description":"From GET /mcp/sse id: line — required for folder 99"},{"key":"mcp_rpc_id","value":"1"}],"item":[{"name":"00 Setup","item":[{"name":"Login (saves access_token)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["if (pm.response.code === 200) {","  const b = pm.response.json();","  const tok = b.access_token || (b.data && b.data.access_token);","  if (tok) {","    const bare = tok.replace(/^Bearer\\s+/i, '').trim();","    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', bare);","    pm.environment.set('access_token', bare);","  }","}","pm.test('Login 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"auth":{"type":"noauth"},"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"username\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"},"url":"{{base_url}}/identity/auth/login"}},{"name":"MCP Health (no auth)","request":{"auth":{"type":"noauth"},"method":"GET","url":"{{base_url}}/mcp/actuator/health"}},{"name":"Market — available indices (helper)","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/market/v1/indices/available"}}]},{"name":"01 Portfolio (3 tools)","description":"MCP tools: get_portfolio_summary, get_holdings, get_holding_detail","item":[{"name":"1. get_portfolio_summary","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/analysis/v1/analysis/dashboard/summary","description":"MCP: `get_portfolio_summary` → am-analysis Mongo holdings book."}},{"name":"2. get_holdings (portfolio REST proxy)","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{base_url}}/portfolio/v1/portfolios/holdings?portfolioId={{portfolio_id}}","host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["portfolio","v1","portfolios","holdings"],"query":[{"key":"portfolioId","value":"{{portfolio_id}}","description":"Optional — omit if empty"}]},"description":"**MCP `get_holdings`** reads am-analysis Mongo (not this API). Use **99 MCP → get_holdings** for exact MCP behavior. This REST proxy hits am-portfolio holdings."}},{"name":"3. get_holding_detail (portfolio REST proxy)","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{base_url}}/portfolio/v1/portfolios/holdings?portfolioId={{portfolio_id}}","host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["portfolio","v1","portfolios","holdings"],"query":[{"key":"portfolioId","value":"{{portfolio_id}}"}]},"description":"MCP: `get_holding_detail` with `symbol={{symbol}}`. Filter response client-side for {{symbol}}, or use **99 MCP → get_holding_detail**."}}]},{"name":"02 Market (4 tools)","description":"MCP tools: get_stock_quote, search_instruments, get_market_movers, get_indices_data","item":[{"name":"4. get_stock_quote","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/market/v1/market-data/quotes?symbols={{symbol}}&refresh=true&timeFrame=5m"}},{"name":"5. search_instruments","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/market/v1/securities/search?query=HDFC"}},{"name":"6. get_market_movers","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{base_url}}/market/v1/analysis/movers?type=all&limit=10&indexSymbol=NIFTY%2050","host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["market","v1","analysis","movers"],"query":[{"key":"type","value":"all","description":"gainers | losers | all"},{"key":"limit","value":"10"},{"key":"indexSymbol","value":"NIFTY 50"}]},"description":"MCP passes type GAINERS/LOSERS; backend expects lowercase. Use `type=all` for unified gainers+losers."}},{"name":"7. get_indices_data","request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"[\"NIFTY 50\", \"NIFTY BANK\"]","options":{"raw":{"language":"json"}}},"url":"{{base_url}}/market/v1/indices/batch?forceRefresh=false"}}]},{"name":"03 Trade (2 tools)","description":"MCP tools: get_recent_activity, get_trade_history","item":[{"name":"8. get_recent_activity","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{base_url}}/trade/v1/trades/filter?page=0&size=20","host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["trade","v1","trades","filter"],"query":[{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}]},"description":"MCP: `get_recent_activity` via am-trade SDK. REST proxy: trade filter (newest first)."}},{"name":"9. get_trade_history","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{base_url}}/trade/v1/trades/filter?symbols={{symbol}}&page=0&size=50","host":["{{base_url}}"],"path":["trade","v1","trades","filter"],"query":[{"key":"symbols","value":"{{symbol}}"},{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"50"}]},"description":"MCP: `get_trade_history` with userId + symbol. REST proxy filters by symbol."}}]},{"name":"04 Analysis (3 tools)","description":"MCP tools: get_top_movers, get_sector_allocation, get_market_cap_allocation","item":[{"name":"10. get_top_movers","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/analysis/v1/analysis/dashboard/top-movers?timeFrame=1D"}},{"name":"11. get_sector_allocation (REST proxy — needs portfolio_id)","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/analysis/v1/analysis/portfolio/{{portfolio_id}}/allocation?groupBy=SECTOR","description":"MCP aggregates all holdings by sector from Mongo. REST proxy needs `portfolio_id`. Use **99 MCP → get_sector_allocation** for exact MCP tool."}},{"name":"12. get_market_cap_allocation (MCP-only)","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"}],"url":"{{base_url}}/analysis/v1/analysis/dashboard/summary","description":"**No public REST** for market-cap allocation. This hits summary as a smoke check only. Use **99 MCP → get_market_cap_allocation** for the real tool."}}]},{"name":"99 MCP tools/call (true MCP — needs mcp_session_id)","description":"Exact MCP JSON-RPC `tools/call` for all 12 tools. Requires open SSE session — set `mcp_session_id` in environment first.","item":[{"name":"MCP initialize","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["const n = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('mcp_rpc_id') || '1', 10);","pm.variables.set('rpc_id', String(n));","pm.collectionVariables.set('mcp_rpc_id', String(n + 1));"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{access_token}}"},{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\n  \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n  \"id\": {{rpc_id}},\n  \"method\": \"initialize\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"protocolVersion\": \"2024-11-05\",\n    \"capabilities\": {},\n    \"clientInfo\": { \"name\": \"postman\", \"version\": \"1.0\" }\n  }\n}"},"url":"{{b